        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6">
        <h3>what makes our coffee special ?</h3>
        <p>At Coffee Haven, we believe great coffee starts with passion and ends with perfection.
           What makes our coffee special is the care we put into every step — 
           from selecting premium beans sourced from trusted farms to roasting them in small batches for maximum 
           freshness. Each cup, whether it’s a bold Espresso or a smooth Cafe Latte,
            is brewed with precision and love. We don’t just serve coffee; we create an experience
             — warm, comforting, and full of flavor. At Coffee Haven, it’s not just about what’s in
              the cup, but the feeling that comes with it.</p>
        <br>
        <p>Quality beans, rich flavor, and a cozy vibe — that’s what makes our coffee special.</p>
        <br>
        <button id="about-btn">learn more.</button>
           </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
